Error [jet.OwnerMovedWhileViewed]: A range write window can't fill a list parameter that may resize
  --> tests/ui/range_write_window_list_param.jet:11:16
    |
 11 |     grow_twice(values[1..2])
    |                ^^^^^^
 Why: A range window has a fixed length, but this function may grow or shrink the list it receives through its write parameter
 Fix: Pass the whole list: `fill(values)`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0212
